Package: OpenTrialDesign
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Clinical Trial Design and Operating Characteristics
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: c(person("Frederico", "Martins", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "45317633+fredsevmartins@users.noreply.github.com"),
    person("OpenTrialDesign contributors", role = "aut"))
Description: Explicit trial specifications and reproducible adapters to established
    fixed sample, group sequential and survival design engines. Simulation outputs
    include Monte Carlo uncertainty and methodological provenance. Engine-specific
    assumptions and inferential limitations are retained.
